#C The patterns in this collection hassle common predecessors of the
#C honey farm constellation. There is an unusual proliferation of
#C oscillators engineered this way due to the honey farm's high level
#C of symmetry and the frequency with which it occurs naturally.
#C
#C This collection contains one example of each period for which
#C a honey farm hassler is known. All periods up to 75 have been
#C achieved in this way except 31, 41, 53, and 67.
#C For discovery credits and additional honey farm hasslers, visit
#C https://conwaylife.com/wiki/Honey_farm_hasslers
#C https://conwaylife.com/wiki/Honey_farm_shuttles
